### 1. Create a new chat session
PUT http://localhost:7071/api/chats/test-chat-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructions": "You are a helpful assistant for an Azure Functions course. Keep answers short."
}

### 2. Send the first message
POST http://localhost:7071/api/chats/test-chat-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "My name is Ali. I'm learning about Azure Functions bindings."
}

### 3. Send a follow-up that depends on remembering message 2
POST http://localhost:7071/api/chats/test-chat-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's my name, and what am I learning about?"
}

### 4. Read back the full conversation history
GET http://localhost:7071/api/chats/test-chat-001
Content-Type: application/json
